constructed
route: GET /pods/<pod>/records/<set>
status: 200
tack-sends: yes
built-from: records-rows.json with `_role` (the role of the hop that wrote the row), as the answer of `?task=<id>` (the task's rows in write order, `_id` ascending)
docket: docket working tree on 2026-10-31, read and not run (uncommitted; API stays 6)
source: ~/Sites/rack-cli/internal-docs/design/records-proposals-2026-10-31.md (a gitignored design note)
date: 2026-10-31
note: the shape is the one of `?sql=`; only `_role` is new. Recapture when docket commits.
